# Why: Raw API extracts are reproducible and should not inflate the public portfolio repository.
data/raw/
# Why: Full cleaned datasets are generated locally; a small safe sample can be added later if desired.
data/processed/*.csv
# Why: Local connection strings contain credentials and must never be committed.
.env
# Why: The SQLite database is generated from the public source and can be rebuilt with the included SQL and scripts.
database/*.db
# Why: Python environments and cache files are machine-specific local artifacts.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
# Why: Editor and operating-system metadata does not belong in the repository.
.DS_Store
.vscode/
